# App.jsx Component Demo Registration

Every new component needs a demo in `src/App.jsx`:

- Own `<Section title="ComponentName">` (or group under a related section for sub-components).
- Wrap demos in `<Fold>` closed by default, with `<FoldTrigger>` / `<FoldContent>`.
- Import alongside other `App.jsx` imports.
